<title>MALAYSIA: EON sells stake in property developer.</title>
<headline>EON sells stake in property developer.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's national car distributor Edaran Otomobil Nasional Bhd (EON) has disposed of its entire 30 percent stake in property developer Masingtai Shanghai Properties Pte Ltd to Kualapura (M) Sdn Bhd for 106.47 million ringgit in cash.</p>
<p>Masingtai, incorporated in Singapore, is currently pursuing property development projects in Shanghai, China.</p>
<p>The divestment was part of the company's rationalisation programme to enable it to focus on its current business activities, EON said in a statement.</p>
<p>Kualapura is a substantial shareholder of EON.</p>
</text>
